   "text": "Policies for each λ ∈ {0, 10, 20, 50, 100, 200, 1000}\nrouter:   argmax_m (Ŷ − λ·Ĉ)\nGPT-4:   fixed column (gpt-4-1106 / gpt_4o)\noracle@λ:   argmax_m (Y − λ·C)\nmatch-GPT-4 oracle:  min C  s.t.  Y ≥ Y_gpt4",
   "originalText": "Policies for each λ ∈ {0, 10, 20, 50, 100, 200, 1000}\nrouter:   argmax_m (Ŷ − λ·Ĉ)\nGPT-4:   fixed column (gpt-4-1106 / gpt_4o)\noracle@λ:   argmax_m (Y − λ·C)\nmatch-GPT-4 oracle:  min C  s.t.  Y ≥ Y_gpt4",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rect-44",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
